%%{init: { 'theme': 'default', 'themeVariables': { 'background': '#ffffff' } }}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant B as Browser
    participant F as Frontend
    participant SM as Security Middleware
    participant AS as Auth Service
    participant SS as Security Service
    participant WS as WebAuthn Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant R as Redis

    Note over U,R: Enhanced Registration with Anti-Spoofing Protection

    U->>B: Access Registration
    B->>F: Load Registration Page
    F->>SM: POST /auth/register/options

    Note over SM: Security Validation Layer
    SM->>SM: Rate Limit Check
    SM->>SM: Generate Device Fingerprint
    SM->>SM: Validate Headers & Origin

    SM->>AS: Validated Request
    AS->>DB: Check User Exists
    DB-->>AS: User Status

    AS->>WS: Generate Registration Options
    Note over WS: Enhanced WebAuthn Options
    WS->>WS: Platform Authenticator Preference
    WS->>WS: Require User Verification
    WS->>WS: Request Attestation
    WS->>WS: Strong Crypto Algorithms

    WS-->>AS: Registration Options
    AS->>R: Store Challenge + Metadata
    AS->>SS: Log Security Event
    AS-->>F: Registration Options

    F->>B: navigator.credentials.create()
    B->>U: Biometric Prompt
    U->>B: Biometric Input

    Note over B: Hardware Security Validation
    B->>B: Liveness Detection
    B->>B: Platform Authenticator
    B->>B: User Verification

    B-->>F: WebAuthn Credential
    F->>SM: POST /auth/register/verify

    Note over SM: Enhanced Security Validation
    SM->>SM: Device Fingerprint Match
    SM->>SM: Request Integrity Check
    SM->>SM: Anti-Replay Validation

    SM->>AS: Validated Credential
    AS->>R: Retrieve Challenge Data
    AS->>SS: Validate Biometric Quality
    SS->>SS: Presentation Attack Detection
    SS->>SS: Credential Uniqueness Check

    AS->>WS: Verify Registration
    WS->>WS: WebAuthn Verification
    WS->>WS: Attestation Validation
    WS->>WS: Liveness Validation

    WS->>DB: Store Encrypted Credential
    AS->>SS: Log Success Event
    AS-->>F: Registration Success + Tokens
    F-->>U: Registration Complete
